  "decision_conditions": [
    "It has not been demonstrated that the proposal would comply with Schedule 2, Part 1, Class A, A.1 (i) of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development)  (England) Order 2015 (as amended).\r\rThe proposed single storey rear extension would sit within 2.00 metres of the boundary of the curtilage of the application site, and the evidence provided does not demonstrate that the eaves would not exceed a height of 3.00 metres. Thus, the proposed development is not permitted under Schedule 2, Part 1, Class A of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended).\r"
